{
  "declaredLength": 1388,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "嗨！请进请进！！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55E8FF018BF78FDB8BF78FDBFF01FF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "转呀转，转呀转，\n食材都在转呀转。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8F6C54408F6CFF0C8F6C54408F6CFF0C000A98DF675090FD57288F6C54408F6C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽说有些食材\n要趁新鲜时吃……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D8BF467094E9B98DF6750000A89818D8165B09C9C65F65403202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "吃得太急，\n结果噎到了……！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54035F97592A6025FF0C000A7ED3679C564E52304E8620262026FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "听说这间店用的食材，\n是从很远的地区采集来的哦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "542C8BF48FD995F45E977528768498DF6750FF0C000A662F4ECE5F888FDC76845730533A91C796C66765768454E630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好厉害！你真是博学多才！！\n（虽然其实是从蔚蓝湾采集来的食材……）",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D53895BB3FF014F60771F662F535A5B66591A624DFF01FF01000AFF08867D713651765B9E662F4ECE851A84DD6E7E91C796C66765768498DF675020262026FF090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在回转梦想家，连打宝可梦对战的\n也是干劲十足呀。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "572856DE8F6C68A660F35BB6FF0C8FDE62535B9D53EF68A65BF962187684000A4E5F662F5E7252B253418DB3544030020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然我不是很懂，\n但这就是所谓的别致美吧？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D713662114E0D662F5F8861C2FF0C000A4F468FD95C31662F62408C137684522B81F47F8E5427FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果要用手吃的话，\n那模仿一下师傅的手法吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C89817528624B540376848BDDFF0C000A90A36A214EFF4E004E0B5E0850857684624B6CD5542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "寿司能让人轻松自在地享用，\n真是太棒了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BFF53F880FD8BA94EBA8F7B677E81EA572857304EAB7528FF0C000A771F662F592A68D24E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "到底是发生了什么事，\n才会这样子吃啊？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "52305E95662F53D1751F4E864EC04E484E8BFF0C000A624D4F1A8FD968375B505403554AFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "和阿罗拉地区的店铺相比，\n味道有细微的不同……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "548C963F7F5762C95730533A76845E9794FA76F86BD4FF0C000A5473905367097EC65FAE76844E0D540C202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这孩子会超越我……\n要趁现在就开始锻炼舌头。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD95B695B504F1A8D858D8A621120262026000A89818D8173B057285C315F0059CB953B70BC820C593430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "当一个能捏寿司的\n训练家也不错啊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F534E004E2A80FD634F5BFF53F87684000A8BAD7EC35BB64E5F4E0D9519554A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请细细品尝。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF77EC67EC654C15C1D30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "回转梦想家的味道\n真的与价格相匹配吗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56DE8F6C68A660F35BB6768454739053000A771F76844E0E4EF7683C76F85339914D5417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "寿司卷……\n魅惑人心的完美结合……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BFF53F8537720262026000A9B4560D14EBA5FC376845B8C7F8E7ED35408202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "享受未知食材的那份从容，\n不正是在对战时也需要的心态吗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EAB53D7672A77E598DF6750768490A34EFD4ECE5BB9FF0C000A4E0D6B63662F57285BF9621865F64E5F9700898176845FC360015417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯，无论面对什么样的对手都处变不惊，\n纯粹地享受对战就好，对吧？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EFFF0C65E08BBA97625BF94EC04E48683776845BF9624B90FD590453D84E0D60CAFF0C000A7EAF7CB957304EAB53D75BF962185C31597DFF0C5BF95427FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "决定好要点什么了吗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51B35B9A597D898170B94EC04E484E865417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "寿司……寿司它\n会自己跑进我的嘴里。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BFF53F8202620265BFF53F85B83000A4F1A81EA5DF18DD18FDB62117684563491CC30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "吃寿司一不小心\n就会拿多呢。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54035BFF53F84E004E0D5C0F5FC3000A5C314F1A62FF591A546230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "吃太多的话会犯困哦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5403592A591A76848BDD4F1A72AF56F054E630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "鼻子呛了一下！？\n真是太刺激了！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9F3B5B50545B4E864E004E0BFF01FF1F000A771F662F592A523A6FC04E86FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是芥末哦，听说在帕底亚\n会把它做成酱汁。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F82A5672B54E6FF0C542C8BF457285E155E954E9A000A4F1A628A5B83505A621091716C4130020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "街上的宝可梦变多了\n就意味着这是商机。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "88574E0A76845B9D53EF68A653D8591A4E86000A5C31610F547377408FD9662F5546673A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们是为庆祝成功签约\n而来这里吃饭的。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC662F4E3A5E86795D6210529F7B7E7EA6000A800C67658FD991CC5403996D768430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "回转梦想家\n在海外也设有分店。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56DE8F6C68A660F35BB6000A57286D7759164E5F8BBE670952065E9730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    }
  ],
